3. WHAT THIS MEANS
==================

Software may be used, modified, distributed, and incorporated into other
works according to the terms of the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Hardware design materials may be used, studied, modified, manufactured,
and distributed according to the terms of the CERN Open Hardware Licence
Version 2 - Strongly Reciprocal.

The strongly reciprocal CERN-OHL-S-2.0 license is intentionally used for
the project's open hardware designs so that covered modifications and
derivative hardware design sources remain available under the terms
specified by that license when its reciprocity requirements apply.

